# macOS
.DS_Store
~$*

# Photos: iPhone/camera files carry EXIF incl. GPS (your location!). Remove it before adding a
# photo here (iPhone share sheet → Options → Location off, or Preview → Tools → Show Inspector →
# GPS → Remove Location Info). Keep untouched originals in photos/originals/ — never committed.
photos/originals/
*.HEIC
*.heic

# CAD sources + office files: local only (publish exported STL/3MF instead)
*.f3d
*.f3z
*.pptx
*.key
